msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"How the fuck did that happen...? I'm a professional\r\n"
"baseball player, dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "How... How could I lose to an amateur...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "That's because your overconfidence got the best of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Manager!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"(Manager? I thought he was a random old man, but it looks like something "
"else is going on here.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"This guy's got stronger willpower than you. That's what it\r\n"
"takes to win."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"No matter how many times he may lose, the man with the\r\n"
"strongest willpower always comes out on top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"You were the number one draft pick, but your ego was so\r\n"
"inflated by those credentials of yours that you were bound\r\n"
"to lose from the start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Makes sense... I got so full of myself that I lost the\r\n"
"will to play. Would you help me get back into shape, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "That's my job, kid. Now get back to the stadium."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Thanks for taking on such an odd request. He really needed\r\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"That kid let the fame get to his head, and his effort\r\n"
"went right out the window."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"But he's got what it takes to be an all-star. He just needed\r\n"
"someone to beat him back into shape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"I think that little batting session may have knocked some\r\n"
"humility into him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"We just hit a few balls in the batting cage. Whether it\r\n"
"sinks in or not is up to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Ain't that the truth. By the way, would you\r\n"
"be interested in a career in professional baseball?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"With that swing of yours, I could get you a nice deal,\r\n"
"even at your age."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"I've got too many things to take care of, but I appreciate\r\n"
"the offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"I understand. You must be a man of high stature in whatever\r\n"
"it is you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah. I promised I'd give you something for your\r\n"
"trouble. Please take this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Spiked Bat<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Well, I better be off to training now. So long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Heh! That was your dose of reality for the day. Don't fuck\r\n"
"with a pro ball player."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"But if you want, I'd be willing to play you again. How\r\n"
"about it? Wanna go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "No thanks. Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"I'll be waiting. Come challenge me whenever you're feeling up to another "
"ass-whooping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Let's do it again. I'll get the best of you this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Hah!  I'll go as long as it takes for you to admit I'm\r\n"
"the better player!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"(A guy in a uniform. This must be who the old man was\r\n"
"talking about.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "What's with you? What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "Hm...? Oh, it's you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"I heard you were hittin' up a storm in here. Even better\r\n"
"than me, they said... Which I find pretty outrageous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"Ten years ago, I won at the high school nationals, was a number one draft "
"pick and went straight to the pros. You really think you're better than me, "
"old man!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"What are you so worked up about? I was in prison ten years\r\n"
"ago, so don't expect me to know who you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"What!? Have you been living under a fucking rock?\r\n"
"Everybody's heard of me! Don't they have TV in jail?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"So you're a big shot pro ball player, are you? Shouldn't\r\n"
"you be somewhere more important getting toned up\r\n"
"for the season?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Shut up! I'm playing second string right now, so I don't\r\n"
"have to worry about shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Second string, huh...? Okay, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "What? The hell is that supposed to mean!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"I'm a professional! Why do I have to waste my time messin'\r\n"
"around with an amateur like you? You'd never beat me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Hey, I never said I wanted to challenge you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"Shut up! This isn't about what you want! This is about <Italic>me</Italic> "
"and what <Italic>I</Italic> need to do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "You've got a big head there, kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid ""
"There's no way an old, inexperienced dude like you could\r\n"
"outhit a professional like me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Guess we won't know till we try. I just might surprise you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Then let's do this shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"We each get ten balls and switch off after each one.\r\n"
"Whoever ends up with the most points is the winner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"Watch closely, old man. I can talk a big game, but I walk\r\n"
"a bigger one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Sorry, I don't think I can help you. Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Backing down now, huh? Ha! Don't have the balls for it,\r\n"
"do you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid ""
"I'll be waiting right here, got it? Come back when you\r\n"
"happen to grow a pair. I'll take you on any time, pops!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "All right. Let's do this."
msgstr "Ok, facciamolo."

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Heh! I'll show you how it's done in the pros!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "You ready to take me on, pops?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "Nah, maybe later, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "Any time, tough guy. I'll cut you down to size."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "You bet. Let's get it started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "Heh! I'll show you how it's done in the pros!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Let's go again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "Let's do this."
msgstr "Diamoci dentro."

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Take Him On"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "Maybe Later"
msgstr "Magari dopo."

